# ============================================================
# Sopeek .gitignore
# ============================================================
# 策略：跟踪所有源码（Python + C++ + Rust），
# 忽略构建中间产物（target/、build/、__pycache__/ 等）。
# 预编译的 .pyd/.dll 也跟踪，方便直接运行。
# ============================================================

# --- Python cache ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Runtime data (user-specific, regenerated on launch) ---
data/
config/

# --- IDE & editor files ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.trae/
.deepseek/
.kagent/

# --- OS files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs & temp files ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- Test & coverage artifacts ---
.pytest_cache/
test_results/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
cov_*.json
*.cache
.icon_cache/
tests/gui/screenshots/
tests/log/

# --- Build artifacts (PyInstaller, Nuitka) ---
build/
dist/
*.spec
*.obj
nuitka-crash-report.xml

# --- Native build outputs (源码目录不得提交编译产物) ---
sopeek/core/native/src/**/*.pyd
sopeek/core/native/src/**/*.dll

# --- Installer / launcher runtime outputs (每次构建重新生成) ---
installer_duilib/install-result.ini
launcher/SPK-Launcher.exe
launcher/SPK-Launcher.exp
launcher/SPK-Launcher.lib

# --- Dotfiles (agent workspaces, code index) ---
.*

# --- Design/markdown notes (not source code) ---
# `*.md` 会忽略仓库里所有 Markdown，因此正式的开发者文档必须在下方显式放行。
# 注意：不要把 `docs/` 整个目录排除，否则父目录被剪枝后，里面的文件无法再用 `!` 重新包含。
*.cube
*.md
!tests/README.md
!sopeek/docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!docs/*.md

# --- Test fixtures ---
# 夹具树需完整入库（含隐藏文件、Markdown、中文名、多层目录），供 native-oracle 逐字段对拍。
# 必须置于 .* 与 *.md 之后才能覆盖它们。
!tests/support/spk_core_fixtures/**
# 上一条的重新包含会连带放行夹具树内的 Python 缓存，这里再次排除。
tests/support/spk_core_fixtures/**/__pycache__/
tests/support/spk_core_fixtures/**/*.pyc

# --- Backup & refactor notes ---
*备份*
*backup*
FIX_SUMMARY.md
EXIT_BLOCK_FIX_SUMMARY.md

# --- Test/demo scripts ---
test_*.py
!tests/
!tests/test_*.py
!tests/**/test_*.py

# ============================================================
# CORE/NATIVE/ — track source code, ignore build intermediates
# ============================================================

# Rust build cache (target/ is entirely reproducible)
sopeek/core/native/src/color_extractor_rust/target/
sopeek/core/native/src/thumbnail_rust/target/
sopeek/core/native/src/spk_core/target/
sopeek/core/native/src/spk_updater/target/

# C++ build directory (msvc .obj, .lib, .exp intermediate files)
sopeek/core/native/src/cpp_lut_preview/build/
outputs/*
docs/native_capabilities.md
